	(text "Notes:\n\nCONSULT THE DATASHEET BEFORE USING ANY \nTIMER/I2C/SPI/UART/ADC PERIPHERALS\n\nFT and FTf pins are 5v tolerant, but output 3.3v levels.\n\nTIM2 is used for SYSTICK, so use other timers if possible.\n\nIt is not recommended to use pins from PF or PC until\nthoroughly consulting the datasheet.\n\nSW Debug is on A13 and A14"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 153.416 124.714 0)
		(effects
